  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 57 plugins and 466 stars, alongside the dsh 0.2.0-rc.2 pre-release; dataelement/dsh-desktop and dsh-market led growth at +83 stars each. With 12,943 of 16,628 non-fork plugins stale for 7+ days and a health score of 39, activity remains concentrated in a few projects.",
    "zh": "过去 <b>8</b> 小时生态新增 <b>57</b> 个插件，官方仓库涨 <b>466</b> 星，并放出 dsh <b>0.2.0-rc.2</b> 预发布；增长榜上 dataelement/dsh-desktop 与 dsh-market 各 +<b>83</b> 星领跑。不过 <b>16628</b> 个非 fork 插件里有 <b>12943</b> 个已 7 天没动静，健康分仅 <b>39</b>，热度集中在少数项目，建议持续观察。"
